{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/3aadfb0cdb65823fcdd76aeafcef4803.avif?t=1759860635\" width=616 height=238 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve ancient puzzles, collect tarot cards, and complete the zodiac trials to climb the mountain and save your people in Ascend, a 3D puzzle adventure. Shift between Day, Twilight, and Dusk with your Time Turner to reveal secrets, alter the landscape, and discover hidden paths. Will you ascend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/80348f21139ef60a638704c5a76d077b.avif?t=1759860635\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras_big/80348f21139ef60a638704c5a76d077b.avif?t=1759860635 width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/96c986a758805126444ab4974ec146b3.poster.avif?t=1759860635\" width=614 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/96c986a758805126444ab4974ec146b3.webm?t=1759860635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/96c986a758805126444ab4974ec146b3.mp4?t=1759860635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save her people and restore balance to the world, Aurora must do what nobody has ever done before: navigate the zodiac trials to scale the mystical mountain and uncover the secrets of a lost civilisation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each challenge contains a puzzle linked to the constellations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/0b349ac4073a9f0e0127582e98706227.avif?t=1759860635\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift between Day, Twilight, and Dusk with the Time Turner. Each time of day has a different effect on the world, revealing secrets, altering the landscape, and opening hidden paths to allow you to solve the puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/8857ba29325094dfb286c4951e827943.poster.avif?t=1759860635\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/8857ba29325094dfb286c4951e827943.webm?t=1759860635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/8857ba29325094dfb286c4951e827943.mp4?t=1759860635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/c309d990f6df3afb653a247bca1e5c6f.avif?t=1759860635\" width=800 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the mysterious tarot cards across the mountain to learn their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/7f3d3fe943f13fb6e0b6f2a6e5598fa5.poster.avif?t=1759860635\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/7f3d3fe943f13fb6e0b6f2a6e5598fa5.webm?t=1759860635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/7f3d3fe943f13fb6e0b6f2a6e5598fa5.mp4?t=1759860635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/96cb539d991fb15f57cc09c7c17a5d2b.avif?t=1759860635\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not the first to attempt this journey. Discover the remnants of past pilgrims, hear their echoes, and uncover the myths that shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/6f3d8a8bad42c396b1bd0290b24fb099.poster.avif?t=1759860635\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/6f3d8a8bad42c396b1bd0290b24fb099.webm?t=1759860635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/6f3d8a8bad42c396b1bd0290b24fb099.mp4?t=1759860635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/2128ab01def4b4f98d6b4b4f91571c77.avif?t=1759860635\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as Aurora must overcome her fears and struggles in the trials, many people face their own struggles with mental health. That\u2019s why we\u2019ve partnered with <strong>Safe in Our World</strong>, a charity focused on supporting mental health awareness through video games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/384b2895eb3d2e15c20f6799e4ef310f.poster.avif?t=1759860635\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/384b2895eb3d2e15c20f6799e4ef310f.webm?t=1759860635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/384b2895eb3d2e15c20f6799e4ef310f.mp4?t=1759860635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/bfcf7e824f24b4889f7df6b37471e4a4.avif?t=1759860635\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1944260/0a119c0d69de1167b119c346529cbf4e9af05f44.jpg"},{"name":"First Ascent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1944260/86295db7ed59718d1bc9b5d58be83b5ace66b0c7.jpg"},{"name":"Starstruck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1944260/b5da0ba7d794af225810f615a0c49beb6b2f824c.jpg"},{"name":"Time Traveller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1944260/a7e79e61332a78aa0a324f6ca11afa426236215a.jpg"},{"name":"Story Seeker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1944260/25cc886e0e44a18454e048852890f0052f8f2eea.jpg"},{"name":"Ancient Words","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1944260/ec280c081c003e238eb3efd3bd55c6bc3c4eb407.jpg"},{"name":"Celestial Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1944260/81b86ef9514